+*   Ambient term constant: 0.1 [S1, unofficial].
+*   Diffuse weight: 0.6 [S1, unofficial].
+*   Specular weight: 0.3 [S1, unofficial].
+*   Specular exponent: 10.0 [S1, unofficial] or 32.0 [S5, unofficial].
